            "review_title": "Review at Little B - Chill Garden",
            "review_text": "Henry Hà\nVietnam3 contributions\n0\nJourney to enjoy Craft Beer at Little B - An ideal place for a group of friends\nOct 2023 • Friends\nLittle B in Thao Dien is not only a craft beer bar, but also an ideal destination for group meetings. I had a great experience here, and below are the points I want to share.\n\nDiverse Craft Beer:\nLittle B is an oasis for those who love to experiment with craft beers. Diverse menu with many options from unique and attractive beers. The staff here are very knowledgeable about beer and ready to advise if you have any questions.\n\nProper Service:\nThe service at Little B is truly commendable. Friendly and agile staff, always happy to assist you in the beer selection process. Not only do they serve beer professionally, but they also create an extremely comfortable atmosphere.\n\nSuper Hot Smoked Dishes:\nIn addition to craft beer, Little B is also famous for its delicious food. In particular, the smoked dishes here are the most special feature. I tried some dishes like grilled meat and smoked sausage - not only delicious but also attractive with their unique flavor.\n\nExtremely Chill Space:\nLittle B's space has a special appeal for those who want to enjoy a comfortable and chill atmosphere. You can choose to sit indoors with comfortable tables and chairs or outdoors to enjoy the chilly air.\n\nSuitable for Groups of Friends:\nLittle B is the perfect choice for group meetings. Spacious and comfortable space, gentle music, along with craft beer and delicious food will create a relaxing and fun atmosphere.\n\nIn short, Little B in Thao Dien is a destination not to be missed for those who love craft beer, delicious cuisine and chill atmosphere. I'm sure you and your group will have an enjoyable experience here.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten November 18, 2023",
